WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,080
Pamphlet: Just let me accompany your dad here.

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:05,320
You go and do your work. Come back when you're free.

3
00:00:06,230 --> 00:00:08,190
Mom, the company hasn’t officially started operations yet.

4
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:09,230
I have more time

5
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:12,740
The old couple was so stunned that they put all their questions back in their stomachs.

6
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,780
I didn’t even tell anyone that my son was out.

7
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:20,220
What are you doing with this feeling of admiration?

8
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:23,180
In the hospital. My dad is hospitalized.

9
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:26,260
What's wrong with uncle? Is it serious? Which hospital is he in?

10
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:29,620
It's nothing serious. It's just a broken bone. Just recover.

11
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:31,820
The hospital environment in Xianling is quite good.

12
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:35,140
Is the soup in the pot still simmering?

13
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:36,900
Put it in a thermos bucket. I want to take it away.

14
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:41,500
It's simmering, but thinking about the scene makes me want to drink it for several days.

15
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:42,460
Don't worry about my brother
